{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "9cce387c16899e20493df740b0afd6c0995dc800d5b306670ec368ebefd6c18c", "ja": "グラビア撮影　休憩中", "zh": "写真拍摄 休息中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6000_place", "source_sha256": "4b25f0985b81f6db929570d4734c6eb8fb0a1860763f2fe9d4b0f5d827a12e42", "ja": "山の頂上", "zh": "山顶", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6001_p", "source_sha256": "879d18ba271ba36ddbd582369a39a209244015f20daab31a05478ed8018a1957", "ja": "（今日は山でグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のロケだ。\n麗花の撮影は順調に進んでいる……）", "zh": "（今天要到山上为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》取景拍摄。\n丽花的拍摄进行得很顺利……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6002_048rei", "source_sha256": "d40aa1ff9a70a2925772856c90d55564da60b661d8cefb3532b236e31a87a516", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、\nちょうどいいところに♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，你来得正好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6003_p", "source_sha256": "b2f2d0b2a004bf417236b2c85e72e776e3269f8fce3cadf6c27271d67ae4e09d", "ja": "麗花、お疲れさま。\nちょうどいいところ？　何かあったか？", "zh": "丽花，辛苦了。\n正好？是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6004_048rei", "source_sha256": "d2e0cf7e8ff9b62454f9b2b3c124e49486659fb8a121562fcac4bf059a09e36a", "ja": "はい。{$P$}さん……\n私と仲良くなるには、どうすればいいと思いますか？", "zh": "是的。{$P$}先生……\n你觉得，要怎样才能和我变得亲近呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6005_p", "source_sha256": "605a64f625ad9f8182d2f6cd4fb6d545dcd6fe6e8d1285799984ca08fe44ead5", "ja": "ん？　麗花と……？\nええと……それは俺とは仲が良くないってことか？", "zh": "嗯？和丽花……？\n呃……你的意思是，我和你还不熟吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6006_048rei", "source_sha256": "7d916f2da52f8294aca8e9222a0079605bdbd044a81374063cc2ebcf4f634953", "ja": "私と{$P$}さんは大の仲良しです♪\nそうじゃなくて、キツネさんの話です。", "zh": "我和{$P$}先生是非常要好的朋友♪\n说的不是这个，是小狐狸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6007_048rei", "source_sha256": "5603ad415ccd914ac2d1d52d14799da83736288b847a8f7b2cd03b14138d00b8", "ja": "さっき、野生のキツネさんを見かけたんです。\n仲良くしようと思って近づいたら、逃げちゃって……。", "zh": "刚才我看到了一只野生狐狸。\n本来想和它友好相处，靠近后却被它逃掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6008_048rei", "source_sha256": "b5b8d17d235aa883db6b73538675210331c9f6cc5ac4e597204f358cf008144c", "ja": "だから、何かいい方法はないかなーって！\n{$P$}さんだったら、どうしますか？", "zh": "所以，我就在想有没有什么好办法呢——！\n如果是{$P$}先生的话，会怎么做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6009", "source_sha256": "f84ba9ebad86fd7b4e0712ea10882a972d71d9021331199547c6de571c3f5ae0", "ja": "ゆっくり近づく", "zh": "慢慢靠近", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6010", "source_sha256": "b17ca4d3bdeeeaffbc5d36b1c3d7e7fd69390b707c28e7d3c021eca0bf941d3d", "ja": "名刺を渡す", "zh": "递出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6011", "source_sha256": "cd786708a7dc3316286b8b335e76d4db5bf622bca27717592e69db71ffbfa87a", "ja": "キツネになりきる", "zh": "化身狐狸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6100_p", "source_sha256": "aec1c741dfeb670c69e084a8b0bc242ef7091c7c3f3ef7120c60b88c8598f71c", "ja": "野生のキツネは警戒心が強いらしい。ゆっくり近づいて\n敵じゃないってアピールしてみるとか？", "zh": "听说野生狐狸戒心很强。要不要慢慢靠近，试着向它表示我们不是敌人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6101_048rei", "source_sha256": "f124534ce8182f378c393516085e98fb31490c352ab81878d54babd7447dc5d4", "ja": "なるほど～。キツネさんと会った時、\n元気よく「こんにちは！」って声かけちゃいました。", "zh": "原来如此～。遇到狐狸时，我还精神十足地喊了声“你好！”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6102_048rei", "source_sha256": "3ab2bf4a3f47fafb3051161b19ff56a7430e07acda13b39cf4e7fae2980834ce", "ja": "次会ったら「私は普通ですよ～」って、ゆっくり\n近づいてみますね。早くキツネさんに会いたいな～♪", "zh": "下次见到它时，我会一边说“我是普通人哦～”，一边慢慢靠近的。真想早点见到狐狸先生啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6200_p", "source_sha256": "95d58c017d7cb69cc237fe856fd9d2a856611a8bf0ae473e54e2d8ed08495ed8", "ja": "キツネにとって、人間は未知の生き物だと思うんだ。\nまずは名刺を渡して、挨拶するのが基本だな。", "zh": "我觉得对狐狸来说，人类是未知的生物。\n首先要递上名片，打个招呼，这是基本礼仪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6201_048rei", "source_sha256": "9e465e460dbf0b382a311ffe9149c5872dc00391e77a45fb0c139356e4dca59b", "ja": "そっか～！　キツネさんにも礼儀は大事ですよね。\n今度見かけたら「はじめまして！」って言ってみます。", "zh": "原来如此～！狐狸也很注重礼仪呢。\n下次见到的话，我要试着说“初次见面！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6202_048rei", "source_sha256": "98e4254da45e6f74a21925c9af497e6e52dd30d8042ab33a1383640e9acedc07", "ja": "{$P$}さんも一緒に行きませんか？\n野生のキツネさんをスカウトしちゃいましょう♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生要不要也一起去？\n我们去挖掘野生的狐狸吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6300_p", "source_sha256": "ca5611fbaaa1eefc8cbada54af51f17dd2ff9219ea17a78abb70ff1b54a8ec4f", "ja": "キツネになりきるのが一番かな。\n仲間と思ってもらえれば、仲良くなれるんじゃないか？", "zh": "还是彻底模仿狐狸最合适吧。\n如果能让它把我们当成同伴，说不定就能和它成为朋友了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6301_048rei", "source_sha256": "b833cef87fb3701c2cafffa082cbed8e6765f2a5b4a040e03b46565a56937ba1", "ja": "ふむふむ……つまり、キツネさんのモノマネをする\nってことですね？　それなら、私にもできそうです。", "zh": "嗯嗯……也就是说，要模仿狐狸对吧？\n这样的话，我好像也能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_6302_048rei", "source_sha256": "98b3eade80c28ee1b11dfe256e6c12f4377510cf218dcdcbf4d25d09f96093ce", "ja": "「コンコン♪　はじめましてコン♪」……うーん、\nこれで大丈夫かな～？　もっと練習が必要かもですね。", "zh": "“吱吱♪初次见面吱♪”……嗯——\n这样应该没问题吧～？可能还需要多练习一下呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
